DASH.glossary.hl={m:"Breadth",d:"New highs = NYSE stocks at a 52-week high; new lows = at a 52-week low. Index up while lows still dominate = a narrow bounce. Friday 27 Nov (half-day): 41 highs vs 42 lows (WSJ), the closest to even since early November, after 33 vs 259 on Wednesday; Friday 20 Nov's 565 lows are the most in our chart (which starts 6 Oct). Lows have beaten highs on every session this month except 4 Nov; several days with more highs than lows would be the first real sign of healing."};

